<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Payment Reminder - Invoice {{invoiceNumber}}</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;
      max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; } .header {
      background-color: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align:
      center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; } .content { background-color:
      #fef2f2; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; } .invoice-details {
      background-color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px
      0; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; } .amount { font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold; color: #dc2626; } .overdue-notice { background-color:
      #fee2e2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 20px 0; } .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <h1>⚠️ Payment Reminder</h1>
      <p>Invoice {{invoiceNumber}} is Overdue</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{clientName}},</p>

      <div class="overdue-notice">
        <p><strong>This invoice is {{daysOverdue}} days overdue.</strong></p>
        <p>Please arrange payment as soon as possible to avoid any service
          interruption.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="invoice-details">
        <p><strong>Invoice Number:</strong> {{invoiceNumber}}</p>
        <p><strong>Issue Date:</strong> {{issueDate}}</p>
        <p><strong>Due Date:</strong> {{dueDate}}</p>
        <p><strong>Amount Due:</strong>
          <span class="amount">${{total}}</span></p>
        <p><strong>Days Overdue:</strong> {{daysOverdue}} days</p>
      </div>

      <p>If you have already processed this payment, please disregard this
        notice. Otherwise, please arrange payment immediately.</p>

      <p>If you're experiencing any issues or need to discuss payment
        arrangements, please contact us as soon as possible.</p>

      <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>

      <p>Best regards,<br />
        {{userFirstName}}
        {{userLastName}}<br />
        {{companyName}}<br />
        {{userEmail}}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated payment reminder. Please contact us if you have
        any questions.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>